[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 181.99, "timestamp": "00:03:01", "text": "考えながらベッドで寝てしまうんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 185.43, "timestamp": "00:03:05", "text": "。 それから、「ああ、今6時半だ。こんな風に目が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 187.43, "timestamp": "00:03:07", "text": "覚めたんだ」って思うんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 189.75, "timestamp": "00:03:09", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 190.869, "timestamp": "00:03:10", "text": "私は目が覚めた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 192.07, "timestamp": "00:03:12", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 197.91, "timestamp": "00:03:17", "text": "少なくとも3日間は連続して練習したかったんです。 ええ、せめて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 200.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:20", "text": "お願いします。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 201.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:21", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 203.697, "timestamp": "00:03:23", "text": "持続する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 204.63, "timestamp": "00:03:24", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 207.589, "timestamp": "00:03:27", "text": "ええ。 最近はいかがお過ごしですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 211.589, "timestamp": "00:03:31", "text": "えっと、私の調子はどうですか？ ああ、いつものように打ちのめされてしまった"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 218.542, "timestamp": "00:03:38", "author": "@AFroznThorn", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UOd53-ssefezO2JWGQi-gSpM4zglLHS2XVfc2UQu3E-TdNk2KGnAZtWYAYqQBudbEouoIqf3=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "6:30 am? ❌ 6:30 pm ✅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 220.07, "timestamp": "00:03:40", "text": "でも、まあ、私は大丈夫でした。 元気でしたか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 221.91, "timestamp": "00:03:41", "text": "？   まあ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 224.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:44", "text": "、大丈夫かな。   まあまあだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 228.47, "timestamp": "00:03:48", "text": "。 特に言うことはないと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 231.03, "timestamp": "00:03:51", "text": "ええ、そうですね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 234.309, "timestamp": "00:03:54", "text": "。 えっと、あなたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 236.07, "timestamp": "00:03:56", "text": "休暇期間はいかがでしたか？ いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 237.99, "timestamp": "00:03:57", "text": "ええ、休暇です。   前回と同じように、2回目がいつ"}]